<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Born unclean, contaminated,</l><l>A totality of sin,</l><l>All discharges foul, contagious;</l><l>Death exuding from within.</l><l>How can such as I approach Thee</l><l>Thou most holy, righteous, clean?</l><l>By Thy Blood, O Lamb, that cleansed me,</l><l>Expiated, God appeased.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Hands once empty now receive Thee;</l><l>We to tent of meeting go;</l><l>Hands are filled with offerings daily,</l><l>Flame divine remains aglow.</l><l>Christ experienced is our offering,</l><l>Meeting not just our own need,</l><l>But, O Father, Thy deep longing:</l><l>Constituting us Thy priests.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Consecration through enjoyment,</l><l>Daily filled with Christ alone.</l><l>Sweetest fragrance now transcendent,</l><l>Mutual satisfaction known.</l><l>Hallelujahs now unceasing!</l><l>Trained to worship and partake.</l><l>Holy, clean, and now rejoicing,</l><l>No more lepers! Priests for aye!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
